  The four options side by side
&lt;/h4&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Fair to all four, because none of them is a trick. An agency that runs well is worth what it charges on the right job, and a good freelancer is the best value in this market on a narrow one. What the columns describe is where the risk sits and who carries it, not a ranking.&lt;/p&gt;

